&lt;b&gt;Capacit&#233;s d&#233;fensives&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;R&#233;sistance-&#192;-La-Canalisation-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;R&#233;sistance &#224; la canalisation (Ext)&quot;&gt;r&#233;sistance &#224; la canalisation&lt;/a&gt; +4, &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Intangible-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Intangible (Ext)&quot;&gt;intangible&lt;/a&gt; ; &lt;b&gt;Immunit&#233;s&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;pagelink&quot; href=&quot;Traits-Des-Morts-Vivants-(Capacit&#233;).html&quot; title=&quot;Traits des morts-vivants (Ext)&quot;&gt;traits des morts-vivants&lt;/a&gt;
